</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="k">default</span><span class="o">:</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">      <span class="c1">// default statements
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="p">}</span></span></span></code></pre>
</div>
<p>概括一下，C 语言的 <code>switch</code> 语句的几点规则：</p>]]></description>
